  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="section-icon">◎</span>
    <span class="section-title">20. Production Checklist</span>
    <span class="section-num">20</span>
  </div>

  <ul class="note-list">
    <li class="ck">Name threads via custom <code>ThreadFactory</code> — deadlocks become searchable in logs.</li>
    <li class="ck">Bound queues + explicit rejection policy — fail loudly instead of exhausting memory.</li>
    <li class="ck">Time out blocking waits — avoid indefinite <code>take()</code> without shutdown story.</li>
    <li class="ck">Clear <code>ThreadLocal</code> in <code>finally</code> for pooled threads.</li>
    <li class="ck">Avoid nested locks without global ordering — graph dependencies occasionally.</li>
    <li class="ck">Expose pool metrics (queue depth, active count) to your observability stack.</li>
    <li class="ck">Stress-test under GC pauses + CPU throttle — races hide until production latency spikes.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="sub">Pick your primitive</h2>
